  "description": "T1 - Horse chestnut - Ruduce southern laterals- 18m in height. No reduction to height. Reduce laterals by 2m from 10m to 8m on the southern side only, where they extend over the neighbouring property at 11 Burbage Road. A mature horse chestnut standing in the rear garden of 9 Burbage Road, close to the southern boundary. Its southern laterals extend across the boundary and over the garden of No 11. The proposed works shorten these laterals back to suitable growth points to reduce the overhang and the end-weight carried on the extended limbs, while the height and the remainder of the crown are left unaltered.",
